al Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0690":{"code":"F-0690","title":"Provide appropriate care for residents who are continent or incontinent of bowel/bladder, appropriate catheter care,  and appropriate care  to prevent urinary tract infections.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0600":{"code":"F-0600","title":"Protect each resident from all types of abuse such as physical, mental, sexual abuse, physical punishment, and neglect by anybody.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0686":{"code":"F-0686","title":"Provide appropriate pressure ulcer care and prevent new ulcers from developing.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0559":{"code":"F-0559","title":"Honor the resident's right to share a room with spouse or roommate of choice and receive written notice before a change is made.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0677":{"code":"F-0677","title":"Provide care and assistance to perform activities of daily living for any resident who is unable.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0607":{"code":"F-0607","title":"Develop and implement policies and procedures to prevent abuse, neglect, and theft.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0609":{"code":"F-0609","title":"Timely report suspected abuse, neglect, or theft and report the results of the investigation to proper authorities.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Def